# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env is gitignored — the
# real values never get committed to source control.
#
# ---- No API keys needed! ----
# The map uses Leaflet (OpenStreetMap tiles) + OSRM routing — both free,
# no API key, no billing. A "Open in Google Maps" link is provided as a
# fallback for real voice navigation on mobile.

# ---- Admin Panel ----
# The hidden admin route's path — there is no visible link to it anywhere in
# the UI; the only way in is Ctrl+Alt+A, available anywhere in the app (not
# just the landing page) on both Windows and macOS (Mac uses Control+Option,
# not Command; see App.vue's handleAdminHotkey). It pushes to this path,
# which must start with "/"
# and must match between router/index.js's read of this var and wherever you
# tell people the hotkey exists. Vite bakes this into the built JS, so it's
# obscurity against casual browsing, not real access control — the actual
# access control is the account login behind it (see server/auth.js).
VITE_ADMIN_PATH=/change-me-secret-path
